":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-08-27T13:39:27Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T13:39:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5 beta6 and likely earlier\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis\n```GDScript\nclass_name BugTheme extends Theme\n\n@export var bug: Array[Shader]\n```\ncauses\n<img width=\"715\" height=\"296\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b68b4d68-5a48-4917-a274-3586acf5fe4c\" />\n\nIt happens when you set the theme as project's default.\nSource is here:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d5ad0556a2c04c50694b5c04dc1b3bf03ecd7113/scene/debugger/scene_debugger.cpp#L470-L471\nI assume the script tries to send some error message too early.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThere might be other cases, but for the one above:\n- Make a new global Script that extends Theme\n- Add exported variable of `Array[Shader]`\n- Create instance of that class and assign some shader\n- Set the theme as `gui/theme/custom` project setting\n- Run the project\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[error2early.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22007614/error2early.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110022/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110022/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}